  {
   "id": "2112825436455448649",
   "url": "https://x.com/meruii1i/status/2112825436455448649",
   "reply_url": "https://x.com/intent/post?in_reply_to=2112825436455448649",
   "username": "meruii1i",
   "name": "minami",
   "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2085064706943791104/6HCC3sNf_normal.jpg",
   "text": "What an Amazing Finale to Edgerunners 2 I Absolutely Loved every Bit of it, \n\nEvery Single Character in this Season has been So interesting in their Own Way's, I love Talia's & Roman's Moments Together so Much They were so cute together,\nTalia is definitely my favourite out of the Group and Of course David & Capri Was such an interesting pair of Characters, Capri really is like Johnny Silverhand from the Game, And I Love how their Story was done until the very End,\n\nOnly Nitpicks i Could Give for this Story is That I wish we could have seen a bit more of their Lives After all the Conflict But Looking at this Now It's a Great way to End It,\nNever though I would See a Happy Ending in Night city of all Places!?\nmy personal Rating for this is An Easy 9'5/10 Such an Amazing Season That in my personal Opinion Went a Bar higher Than Season 1 in terms of Storytelling and of How all the Characters were Written And For now my Personal Anime of the Year, favourite Episode has to Be 8 Like that was Absolutely Incredible also an Eoty contender for me,\n\nAmazing Work From Kai Ikarashi He's definitely one of my favourite Directors in the industry Can't wait to see his Next project with Soigne, \n#CyberpunkEdgerunners\n#イバーパンクエッジランナーズ",
   "created_at": "2026-10-21T17:36:53+09:00",
